        "after": "import clsx from \"clsx\";\n\n/**\n * @summary route 전용 entry tree 렌더링 계약\n */\ninterface EntryTreeProps {\n  /**\n   * @field 렌더링할 entry 목록\n   */\n  entries: Array<{id: string; label: string}>;\n  /**\n   * @field 선택된 entry ID\n   */\n  selectedId?: string;\n}\n\nexport const EntryTree = (props: EntryTreeProps) => {\n  const {entries, selectedId} = props;\n\n  return (\n    <ul className={clsx(\"ui_entryTree\", selectedId && \"ui_entryTree--selected\")}>\n      {entries.map((entry) => (\n        <li key={entry.id}>{entry.label}</li>\n      ))}\n    </ul>\n  );\n};\n",
        "afterSha256": "sha256:f6a80f29959f02f9841d3c0e988181e199c80d3ed2a56fa743ad45bd53025cdf"
      }
    ],
    "summary": "route 전용 tree renderer를 shared UI에서 entries route의 -local 소유 경계로 이동하고 Ui 접두사를 제거했다. 기존 clsx import, className 문자열, 렌더링 동작은 유지했다."
